Implemented and proved `find_max` over arbitrary finite modeled string lists.

- Deliverables: [solution.py](/workspace/solution.py), [solution.mpy](/workspace/solution.mpy), [verification.k](/workspace/verification.k), [spec.k](/workspace/spec.k), [prove.sh](/workspace/prove.sh), [PROOF.md](/workspace/PROOF.md)
- `prove.sh` exits 0; all positive proofs print `#Top`.
- Gates A, B, and C pass; proof quality is `VALIDATED`.
- Negative mutation probes fail as expected; 6,104 differential cases report zero mismatches.

RESULT: KPROVE_PASSED — The unbounded full-domain target proof passed and Gate B covers the complete HumanEval contract.
